              "page": 1,
              "text": "Supplement | Reagent doses\nSynthetic fixture, linked to the main synthetic study.\nTrial A: H2O2 dose was 20 mg/L.\nTrial B: H2O2 dose was 20 mg/L.\nSynthetic fixture | PDF page 1\n"
            }
          ],
          "warnings": [],
          "parser": "pypdf"
        }
      ]
    }
